  "question": "Where’s the nearest restaurant heading southeast from Epic Strides, Plano, TX?",
  "sql": "SELECT poi_name, addr_city, addr_state FROM pois WHERE amenity = 'restaurant' AND degrees(ST_Azimuth( ( SELECT geometry FROM pois WHERE poi_name ILIKE '%Epic Strides%' AND addr_city ILIKE '%Plano%' AND addr_state ILIKE '%TX%' LIMIT 1 ), geometry )) BETWEEN 112.5 AND 157.5 ORDER BY ST_Distance( ( SELECT geometry FROM pois WHERE poi_name ILIKE '%Epic Strides%' AND addr_city ILIKE '%Plano%' AND addr_state ILIKE '%TX%' LIMIT 1 )::geography, geometry::geography ) LIMIT 1;",
